<title>INDIA: India Anagram Finance 1995/96 net rises.</title>
<headline>India Anagram Finance 1995/96 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   446.99 vs   286.22</p>
<p>    Net Income	 1,945.56 vs 1,329.14</p>
<p>    Other income	  33.60 vs    22.35</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  316.62 vs   199.84</p>
<p>    Interest	     955.26 vs   715.86</p>
<p>    Gross profit	 707.27 vs   435.80</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 260.28 vs   122.09</p>
<p>    Tax			0.00 vs    27.50</p>
<p>Note: Anagram Finance is a finance company belonging to the Lalbhai group based in Ahmedabad. The company approved the results at a board meeting on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom (91-11-301 2024)</p>
</text>
